				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2014 16:58:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Tldk</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1697613</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Upon reentering Site-██, Agent Lament and Agent Dodridge reviewed the file and realized that they could throw bottles at SCP-723-D without problems. They then proceeded to hurl glass bottles at him, breaking most, until SCP-723-D requested that they stop.</p> <p>At this point, SCP-723-D was instructed to “not sass me” by Agent Lament, resulting in SCP-723-D being repeatedly struck with a cricket bat, taken from the locker of Dr. Light.</p> <p>This was my favorite part of this incredible story. Best decomm I've read, even better then the 083 one. 1+</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
